Figure 1: Summary of observational data used for V819 Her.
Panel (a) shows the temporal distribution of astrometric (blue), ETV (green), and RV (red) data;
panel (b) presents the corresponding measurement counts;
panels (c) and (d) display segments of the TESS light curve from Sectors 52–53, including a close-up of a single orbital cycle.
